        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ umuntu wese wo mu Bisirayeli, canke wo mu banyamahanga baba muri bo, azogira ico afata ari guhīga, ar’ igikōko, ar’ igisīga, cank’ inyoni, mu vyemerwa kuribga, amaraso yaco az’ ayareke amiminukire hasi, ayarenzekw ivu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
