                  "text": "Ita 9:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ ubugingo bg’icaremwe cose ar’ amaraso yaco; ni co catumye nihanikiriza Abisirayeli, nti Ntimuze mwigere mugeza mu kanwa icitwa amaraso y’icaremwe ic’ ari co cose, kuk’ ubugingo bg’icaremwe cose ar’ amaraso yaco: ūzoyageza mu kanwa wese az’ acibge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
